          ],
          "content": "Ganita Prakash | Grade 8"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.213,
            0.106,
            0.497,
            0.126
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Properties of a rhombus —"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.236,
            0.13,
            0.823,
            0.152
          ],
          "content": "y The opposite sides of a rhombus are parallel to each other."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.237,
            0.154,
            0.823,
            0.193
          ],
          "content": "In a rhombus, the adjacent angles add up to 180°, and the opposite angles are equal."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.237,
            0.196,
            0.823,
            0.236
          ],
          "content": "The diagonals of a rhombus bisect each other at right angles."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.237,
            0.239,
            0.694,
            0.26
          ],
          "content": "y The diagonals of a rhombus bisect its angles."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.263,
            0.823,
            0.304
          ],
          "content": "A **kite** is a quadrilateral with two non-overlapping adjacent pairs of sides having the same length."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.311,
            0.825,
            0.351
          ],
          "content": "A **trapezium** is a quadrilateral having at least one pair of parallel opposite sides."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.359,
            0.766,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": " The sum of the angle measures in a quadrilateral is 360°."
        },
        {
